{"id":"e09695d13f301942","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-rec-equal-tm.md","title":"Recursive = Turing Computable","display":"prop-rec-equal-tm — Recursive = Turing Computable","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-rec-equal-tm","aliases":["92-prop-rec-equal-tm"],"display":"prop-rec-equal-tm — Recursive = Turing Computable","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-mu-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-rec-equal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-rec-equal-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-rec-equal-tm — Recursive = Turing Computable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"301cfe50f6e97873\" href=\"?note=301cfe50f6e97873\" title=\"92-df-mu-recursive\">92-df-mu-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity and total function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> (recursive-function predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\)</span> (Turing-computable predicate in a fixed deterministic Turing-machine model with an effective tuple encoding)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rec\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rec\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归函数 = Turing可计算函数（对于全函数）</li>\n<li>这是两个形式计算模型之间的数学等价定理，不是把非形式的“有效可计算”同形式模型等同的Church–Turing论题</li>\n<li>μ递归 = PR + μ运算</li>\n<li>Turing机可以计算μ运算（搜索）</li>\n<li>μ运算对应Turing机的无限搜索</li>\n<li>因此递归 = Turing可计算</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"301cfe50f6e97873","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-mu-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ (recursive-function predicate for $f$, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rec\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1250,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b","301cfe50f6e97873"]}